ーが好きなので書いて欲しいです。\n構図などはお任せします。お腹をでっかく書いてくれれば嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lizardon1/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/037dbcd9/uploads/origins/8207040b-b576-466a-8501-0644a5d11754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b27bfbda74404b49b6be80806e481307", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/037dbcd9/uploads/origins/8207040b-b576-466a-8501-0644a5d11754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b27bfbda74404b49b6be80806e481307, https://si.imgix.net/037dbcd9/uploads/origins/8207040b-b576-466a-8501-0644a5d11754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1fb83082fd8915b41dfcefd4fa9e075 2x, https://si.imgix.net/037dbcd9/uploads/origins/8207040b-b576-466a-8501-0644a5d11754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56bb4c620be3b9edfb561afc4551aeef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nブラックドラゴンのデビルンのお腹が風船のように膨らんだ姿を描いて欲しい。細かい構図等はお任せします。\nお手数ですが、宜しくお願いします。\n\n参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lIqliMxlO0jZ0LO6XUmzujgF3_6NG5bW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lizardon1/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a94f9996/uploads/origins/b8cc2f7b-e208-4537-a8db-943135d525d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d3e4f4d42dcb654df41911769877a66", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a94f9996/uploads/origins/b8cc2f7b-e208-4537-a8db-943135d525d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d3e4f4d42dcb654df41911769877a66, https://si.imgix.net/a94f9996/uploads/origins/b8cc2f7b-e208-4537-a8db-943135d525d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35ff1d31f902ee2c8116c130f48dedb7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a94f9996/uploads/origins/b8cc2f7b-e208-4537-a8db-943135d525d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=726